# Styling Conventions

Follow existing patterns. Do not introduce new patterns.

## Structure

- One `styles.module.less` per component, colocated
- Import: `import styles from './styles.module.less'`
- Use: `className={styles.myClass}`
- Avoid inline styles except for dynamic values

## Class Names

- **camelCase** for class names (`.planTitleContainer`, `.summaryTitleContainer`)
- Semantic, component-scoped names

## Variables

- Use variables from `src/styles/variables.less` (e.g. `@black`, `@primary-color`)

## Ant Design Overrides

- Use `:global(.ant-select)` etc. for antd component overrides
- Scope overrides inside a component class, e.g. `.planSelect :global(.ant-select-selector)`

